<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5362/5402.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5362/5402.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5362/5402 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Thursday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Friday will be 5382.</p>
<p>On Wednesday the bid/offer rates were 5359/5399, with the official dollar rate 5379 from Thursday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5219/5819 after 5216/5816.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
